          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>the importance of the relationship commitment to the company, the process and the person you are placing. You make it about the company as a whole, not just a particular search. </em></p><p class="sqsrte-small" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>I loved that the experience and process wasn’t rigid and formulaic. You consistently demonstrated flexibility to work with us in a way that worked best for us. </em></p><p class="sqsrte-small" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>The depth of knowledge on each candidate made our time with them well spent. When we went down the path with a candidate, and especially the final candidates, it was worth it to the end!”</em></p>
