          <p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>AvidEdge brought to the process were unlike anything I’ve experienced. When my CEO and direct boss unexpectedly left just weeks into my new role, the coaching support became invaluable. My coach was there every step of the way.</em></p><p class="sqsrte-small" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>Today, I’m excelling in a much larger role, and I credit AvidEdge not just for placing me in the right position but for equipping me with the support and insight to succeed in the face of change. Their approach goes beyond recruiting—it’s about setting leaders up for long-term success."</em></p>
